[17.016,"o","\r\n"]
[17.136,"o","Usage: nuvira skills [options] [command]\r\n\r\nSkills hub — search, install, update, and audit community skills (J3)\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -h, --help                  display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  search [options] <query>    Search all configured skill registries (I7 P1\r\n                              multi-source)\r\n  install [options] <name>    Install a skill from the configured registries\r\n                              into <project>/.agents/skills/ (sandboxed,\r\n                              checksummed)\r\n  uninstall [options] <name>  Uninstall a skill: removes .agents/skills/<name>\r\n                              and its provenance record\r\n  update [options]            Update installed skills to newer registry\r\n                              versions (checksum-verified)\r\n  bundle [options] [slug]     P6b — skill bundles: group skills under one id\r\n                              and load them together (Hermes parity)\r\n  list [options]              List installed skills with provenance (origin:\r\n                              registry vs local)\r\n  help [command]              display help for command\r\n"]
