[19.362,"o","Usage: nuvira tools [options] [command]\r\n\r\nInspect the agent tool registry (pipeline + experience tools)\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -h, --help                display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  list                      List every registered tool (the H1 tool-calling\r\n                            surface)\r\n  show <name>               Show a tool's description and input schema\r\n  toolsets [options]        List toolset groups (capability gating) with\r\n                            enabled state; enable/disable a group\r\n  install [options] [name]  Install the optional dependency an optional tool\r\n                            needs (see `nuvira tools optional`)\r\n  optional                  List tools that are shipped but need an optional\r\n                            dependency installed\r\n  help [command]            display help for command\r\n"]
