[23.151,"o","\r\n  ── Admin Governance Policy (P6 M6.5) ──\r\n\r\n  ⚖️  Policy is EMPTY — fully permissive. Auto routing may use any provider × model.\r\n      Add rules with:  nuvira admin allow <provider> · nuvira admin deny <provider>\r\n                      nuvira admin allow-model <model> · nuvira admin max-cost <usd>\r\n\r\n  No rules active — every provider × model is eligible\r\n  Rules are admin-HARD: violating providers are eliminated, never just scored lower.\r\n"]
