[24.914,"o","Usage: nuvira audit verify [options]\r\n\r\nVerify hash-chain integrity of audit stores (tamper detection)\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -f, --file <path>  Verify a specific JSONL audit file (default: built-in\r\n                     stores)\r\n  --json             Machine-readable JSON verdict (exit 0 = ok, 1 =\r\n                     tampered/corrupt, 2 = legacy)\r\n  -h, --help         display help for command\r\n"]
