[26.588,"o","Usage: nuvira sbom [options]\r\n\r\nGenerate and verify the CycloneDX software bill of materials (P6 M6.6)\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -o, --out <path>  Write the SBOM JSON to a file (default: stdout)\r\n  --reproducible    Pin the serial + timestamp for byte-identical rebuilds\r\n  --json            Machine-readable JSON output for verify\r\n  --verify          Verify a stored SBOM against package-lock.json\r\n  --sbom <path>     SBOM file to verify (default: sbom.json in project root)\r\n  --licenses        License audit only (copyleft/unknown flagging)\r\n  -h, --help        display help for command\r\n"]
