[31.442,"o","🌐 Gateway status\r\n\r\n  ✅ gateway RUNNING — pid 1697, up 1d 6h, 4/4 adapters live, beat 2s ago\r\n\r\n  ✅ Telegram (long-poll, Bot API)\r\n  ✅ Slack (webhook)\r\n  ✅ WhatsApp (Baileys bridge — paired, self-chat mode, session: ~/.nuvira/whatsapp/session)\r\n  ✅ SMS (Twilio +••••••••••)\r\n  ⬜ Discord (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ WhatsApp Business (Meta Cloud API, not configured)\r\n  ⬜ DingTalk (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ Feishu (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ WeCom (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ Mattermost (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ Matrix (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ Webhook (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ BlueBubbles (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ ntfy (not configured — set BUFF_NTFY_TOPIC)\r\n  ⬜ Teams (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ Google Chat (not configured)\r\n  ⬜ Weixin (not configured — set BUFF_WEIXIN_TOKEN)\r\n  ⬜ IRC (not configured — set IRC_SERVER)\r\n  ⬜ SimpleX (not configured — set SIMPLEX_WS_URL)\r\n  ⬜ Home Assistant (not configured — set HASS_TOKEN)\r\n  ⬜ Email (not configured — set BUFF_SMTP_HOST + BUFF_SMTP_USER)\r\n  ⬜ Signal (not configured — set BUFF_SIGNAL_ACCOUNT)\r\n  … (11 more lines)\r\n"]
