[34.105,"o","Usage: nuvira execute [options] [goal]\r\n\r\nRun a multi-agent pipeline to accomplish a goal\r\n\r\nArguments:\r\n  goal                               The goal to accomplish (omit for\r\n                                     interactive development mode)\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -p, --provider <provider>          Inference provider for all agents\r\n  -m, --model <model>                Model override for all agents\r\n  --planner-model <model>            Model for the Planner agent\r\n  --gatherer-model <model>           Model for the Context Gatherer agent\r\n  --writer-model <model>             Model for the Writer agent\r\n  --reviewer-model <model>           Model for the Reviewer agent\r\n  --dry-run                          Preview changes without writing to disk\r\n                                     (default: false)\r\n  -v, --verbose                      Show detailed agent output (default:\r\n                                     false)\r\n  --memory                           Enable persistent memory (learn from past\r\n                                     sessions) (default: false)\r\n  --memory-stats                     Show memory statistics and exit (default:\r\n                                     false)\r\n  --memory-clear                     Clear all stored memory trajectories\r\n                                     (default: false)\r\n  --context-limit <tokens>           Max context tokens before pruning\r\n  … (76 more lines)\r\n"]
