[36.714,"o","Usage: nuvira chat [options] [prompt]\r\n\r\nStart an interactive chat session with AI\r\n\r\nArguments:\r\n  prompt                     Optional initial prompt\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -f, --file <path>          Include file content as context\r\n  -p, --provider <provider>  Inference provider to pin this chat to\r\n  -m, --model <model>        Model to pin this chat to (if omitted, an\r\n                             interactive picker will appear)\r\n  --no-cache                 Disable response caching\r\n  -d, --dev                  Always dispatch requests to the coding pipeline\r\n                             (no confirmation) (default: false)\r\n  --worktree                 Run this turn in its own git worktree of the\r\n                             project and report the diff against the base\r\n                             commit. Refuses rather than running unisolated\r\n                             when the directory cannot be isolated (also asked\r\n                             for by NUVIRA_ISOLATE=1)\r\n  --keep-worktree            Keep the isolated worktree after the turn instead\r\n                             of removing it\r\n  --resume [id]              Replay the recorded steps of this ask whose input\r\n                             is unchanged instead of paying for them again\r\n                             (defaults to the record for this goal + directory;\r\n                             also asked for by NUVIRA_RESUME=1)\r\n  … (8 more lines)\r\n"]
