[41.947,"o","Usage: nuvira benchmark [options] [command]\r\n\r\nRun standardized model benchmarks against coding tasks\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -h, --help         display help for command\r\n\r\nCommands:\r\n  run [options]      Run the benchmark suite\r\n  list               List available benchmark tasks\r\n  results [options]  Show previous benchmark results\r\n  clear              Clear all benchmark data\r\n  help [command]     display help for command\r\n"]
